<title>INDIA: Bombay benchmark stocks index valuations-Peregrine.</title>
<headline>Bombay benchmark stocks index valuations-Peregrine.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of the Bombay Stock Exchange's index valuations published by Peregrine Capital which, the securities firm says, continue to look attractive.</p>
<p>		 BSE INDEX VALUATIONS</p>
<p>Year	 Earnings    P/E   P/CE   P/B   Yield</p>
<p>		growth</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------- 1991-92     -28.6%    33.7   19.9   8.5   0.90%</p>
<p>1992-93     -13.3%    39.0   21.1   3.4   0.92%</p>
<p>1993-94	48.1%    26.3   17.5   4.4   1.18%</p>
<p>1994-95	42.7%    18.5   13.4   3.1   1.48%</p>
<p>1995-96	30.1%    12.5    9.9   --    1.51%</p>
<p>1996-97E     11.6%    11.3    8.7   --    1.55%</p>
<p>1997-98E     19.4%     9.4    7.4   --    1.67%</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, +91-22-265 9000</p>
